"I planned to explain," I say. "I was waiting for the right moment."

"Barry, we made a pact to minimize bloodshed!" Daren's voice cracks with indignation. "Why would you execute them?"

"They gave me no choice," I say. "It was them or me."

"That statement is inaccurate," the Overseer drones. "Both individuals were unconscious at the moment of termination, presenting zero active threat."

}
#if(v_b3_ch9_enemies == 0 && v_b3_ch4_billy != 7 && v_b3_ch4_billy != 8) {
"Selection is ongoing," the Overseer says. "The candidate must be malleable yet competent enough to conceal my administration. Public disclosure of a construct ruler would provoke civil instability."

"Understood," Melindra says.

}
#if(v_b3_ch4_billy == 7 && v_b3_ch9_enemies == 0 && v_b3_ch8_king != 5 || v_b3_ch4_billy == 8 && v_b3_ch9_enemies == 0 && v_b3_ch8_king != 5) {
"The official monarch will be Breynan, as previously arranged," the Overseer says. "That was our covenant."

"Right," Melindra says with a shrug. "I forgot. My mistake."

}
#if(v_b3_ch4_billy == 7 && v_b3_ch8_king == 5 && v_b3_ch9_enemies == 0 || v_b3_ch4_billy == 8 && v_b3_ch8_king == 5 && v_b3_ch9_enemies == 0) {
"The official monarch will be Breynan, as previously arranged," the Overseer says. "That was our covenant."

"We discussed Kelrim as an alternative," Daren reminds him. "You agreed to revisit the matter after the fighting ended."

"Correct," the Overseer says. "However, initial support was contingent on Breynan's coronation. Analysis indicates the goblin would not cooperate with machine governance. Securing your adherence to our original agreement is precisely why you were brought to this plane. Does our pact stand?"

"You're right," Daren says, his shoulders sinking. "We accepted Breynan as your condition. It is too late to alter it now. I only expect you to honor your remaining promises."

"That is within protocol parameters," the Overseer says.

}
#if(v_b3_ch9_enemies == 2 && v_b3_ch4_billy <= 9) {
"The king of the underground ordered our assassination," I say. "What guarantee did we have that he wouldn't try again the moment he escaped? And what about Leila and Reidzek? How could we leave them in Ollendor with that maniac free?"

"You cannot make summary executions on a whim!" Daren says, pain in his voice. "We are talking about human lives! Even if the king ordered the hit, there is zero evidence Peter had a hand in it. Did you slaughter him merely for being a witness?"

"That was part of it," I admit. "But Peter was his direct lieutenant. Even if he didn't give the command, he knew about the plot."

"You disappoint me, Barry," Daren says quietly, turning away. "I thought you were better than this. I truly did."

He trails off, staring into the bright ether.

"Never mind," he says after a heavy pause. "My words won't undo what you did. What's done is done. We focus on what lies ahead."

"Overseer," Melindra interjects, breaking the tension, "if you intend to govern from behind the curtain, who takes the throne as figurehead?"

}
#if(v_b3_ch9_enemies == 3 && v_b3_ch4_billy <= 9) {
"Barry, I cannot believe what you're saying," Daren says, his voice thick with dismay. "The king of the underground was ruthless, but—"

"He was more than ruthless," I say. "He ordered our assassination. What guarantee did we have that he wouldn't try again the moment he escaped? And what about Leila and Reidzek? How could we leave them in Ollendor with that maniac free?"

"You cannot make summary executions on a whim!" Daren says, pain in his voice. "We are talking about human lives! Even if the king ordered the hit, there is zero evidence Peter had a hand in it. Did you slaughter him merely for being a witness?"

"That was part of it," I admit. "But Peter was his direct lieutenant. Even if he didn't give the command, he knew about the plot."

"You disappoint me, Barry," Daren says quietly, turning away. "I thought you were better than this. I truly did."

He trails off, staring into the bright ether.

"Never mind," he says after a heavy pause. "My words won't undo what you did. What's done is done. We focus on what lies ahead."

"Overseer," Melindra interjects, breaking the tension, "if you intend to govern from behind the curtain, who takes the throne as figurehead?"

}
#if(v_b3_ch9_enemies == 2 && v_b3_ch4_billy != 7 && v_b3_ch4_billy != 8 || v_b3_ch9_enemies == 3 && v_b3_ch4_billy != 7 && v_b3_ch4_billy != 8) {
